  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A wave of healing energy washes out from a point of your choice within range. Choose up to six creatures in a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on that point. Each target regains hit points equal to 5d10 + your creative ability modifier. This creation has no effect on undead or constructs.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation with a creation slot of 6th level or higher, the healing increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 5th.</p>",
